sequenceDiagram
    actor Investigator
    participant UI as TrialIQ Investigator Console
    participant API as FastAPI /query/agent
    participant LLM as TrialIQ LLM Service
    participant SUP as SupervisorAgent
    participant MCP as FastMCPRetrievalClient
    participant TOOL as TrialIQ MCP find_related_trials
    participant NEO as Neo4j
    participant VAL as ValidationAgent

    Investigator->>UI: Ask guided related-study question
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/query/agent
    API->>LLM: Request ExtractedQueryIntent
    LLM-->>API: Typed intent
    API->>SUP: Run AgentRequest
    SUP->>MCP: Retrieve supported evidence
    MCP->>TOOL: find_related_trials(...)
    TOOL->>NEO: Fixed bounded read query
    NEO-->>TOOL: Related-trial paths + study fields
    TOOL-->>MCP: Typed RelatedTrialSearchResponse
    MCP-->>SUP: RetrievalResult (transport=mcp)
    SUP->>SUP: Compute deterministic metrics trace

    alt candidate_count > 6
        SUP-->>API: REVIEW_REQUIRED + HumanReviewCheckpoint
        API-->>UI: Candidate review payload
        Investigator->>UI: Analyse selected / Analyse all
        UI->>API: POST /api/v1/query/agent/continue
        API->>SUP: Resume stored run
        SUP->>SUP: Apply selection to existing retrieval
    end

    SUP->>VAL: Validate selected evidence
    VAL-->>SUP: can_synthesize + warnings/errors
    SUP->>LLM: Request StructuredSynthesis
    LLM-->>SUP: Typed grounded synthesis
    SUP-->>API: AgentRunResult
    API-->>UI: Answer + studies + connections + evidence + trace
    UI-->>Investigator: Grounded investigation result
